      "text": "The habit no man talks about.",
      "pause": "short"
    },
    {
      "id": "weak",
      "text": "A weak man gives in every time he is bored, tired or alone."
    },
    {
      "id": "hates",
      "text": "Then he hates himself, and repeats it tomorrow.",
      "pause": "short"
    },
    {
      "id": "strong",
      "text": "A strong man knows an urge is a wave."
    },
    {
      "id": "rises",
      "text": "It rises."
    },
    {
      "id": "passes",
      "text": "It passes.",
      "pause": "short"
    },
    {
      "id": "stands",
      "text": "He stands up."
    },
    {
      "id": "leaves",
      "text": "He leaves the room."
    },
    {
      "id": "moves",
      "text": "He moves his body."
    },
    {
      "id": "phone",
      "text": "The phone stays outside the bedroom.",
      "pause": "long"
    },
    {
      "id": "rule",
      "text": "Control your urges, or they will control you.",
      "pause": "hold"
    },
    {
      "id": "cta",
      "text": "Follow for more rules."
